BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cuba & Alaska
DTSTART:20260512T200000Z
DTEND:20260512T214500Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T200000Z
UID:4prKIvyVvV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nAmid the carnage of war in Ukrain
 e\, frontline medics Cuba and Alaska risk their lives to save others\, for
 ging an unbreakable bond of friendship while holding onto dreams of a life
  beyond conflict.Producer Olha Bregman scheduled to participate in virtual
  Q&A at both screenings.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/cuba-and-alaska\
 n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 3 (Wed 13 May\, 5:45 PM)\n\nEstima
 ted start: 13:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:American Doctor
DTSTART:20260512T223000Z
DTEND:20260513T001500Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T223000Z
UID:d2K2voL1ja
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nThree courageous doctors—a Jewi
 sh orthopedic surgeon from North Carolina\, a Zoroastrian trauma surgeon f
 rom California\, and a Palestinian American ER specialist from Illinois—
 volunteer their services in Gaza\, risking their lives to save others.Dire
 ctor Poh Si Teng scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ame
 rican-doctor\n\nEstimated start: 15:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:One of Our Own: A Tribute to Joan Roca
DTSTART:20260513T010000Z
DTEND:20260513T022000Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T010000Z
UID:8CdFov6Nts
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nCatalan chef Joan Roca\, hailed a
 s the “Messi of the kitchen\,” is a revolutionary force in gastronomy.
  Twenty of Spain’s top chefs\, together holding 70 Michelin stars\, unit
 e to craft an extraordinary banquet celebrating Roca’s generosity\, visi
 on\, and pioneering culinary genius.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/one-
 of-our-own-a-tribute-to-joan-roca\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 
 2 (Wed 13 May\, 1:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 18:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tell Everyone
DTSTART:20260513T033000Z
DTEND:20260513T053500Z
DTSTAMP:20260513T033000Z
UID:QCyd6RR917
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nOn a remote island where trouble
 some women are sent to be forgotten\, an emotionally charged struggle for 
 liberation unfolds in a dazzlingly beautiful and deeply moving historical 
 drama.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/tell-everyone\n\nEstimated start: 
 20:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
